1
00:00:04,471 --> 00:00:05,505
Then...

2
00:00:05,505 --> 00:00:07,440
Can I get some dating advice?

3
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:10,744
That's really unexpected.

4
00:00:10,744 --> 00:00:11,978
So what is it?

5
00:00:11,978 --> 00:00:13,947
I had someone who liked me

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,125
and at some point, I started
to get attracted, too.

7
00:00:16,149 --> 00:00:18,189
Didn't you say you don't like
those kinds of people?

8
00:00:18,451 --> 00:00:19,686
I used to be like that.

9
00:00:20,053 --> 00:00:22,322
But they came to me
like a butterfly.

10
00:00:22,655 --> 00:00:24,624
I don't want to let my fears
drive them away

11
00:00:24,824 --> 00:00:26,459
I'll regret it forever.

12
00:00:27,127 --> 00:00:28,828
So what?

13
00:00:28,928 --> 00:00:30,463
You want my advice?

14
00:00:30,764 --> 00:00:32,165
I'm not sure If I should
tell them my feelings.

15
00:00:32,165 --> 00:00:33,466
But aren't you two mutual?

16
00:00:34,334 --> 00:00:36,036
Then go for it.

17
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:37,337
What's stopping you?

18
00:00:37,771 --> 00:00:40,507
I'm happy you found
someone nice.

19
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,175
I guess it is how it is.

20
00:00:43,009 --> 00:00:45,779
But at least I'm not
anxious anymore.

21
00:00:45,779 --> 00:00:47,947
They're both good people.

22
00:00:48,348 --> 00:00:50,316
My nightmare isn't going
to happen again.

23
00:00:50,316 --> 00:00:51,316
I like you.

24
00:00:58,758 --> 00:00:59,893
I like you too, Yijun.
